  "faq.becauseRevenueMeant": "Amarga bathine dimaksudake kanggo mbayar wong-wong iku. Game diwiwiti babar pisan digawe AI supaya bisa ana; desainer sing dibayar banjur ngganti gawean AI, kanthi jeneng dikreditake.",
  "faq.canIPlay": "Apa aku bisa main online?",
